        <fields>
            <name>InvalidFormatMessage</name>
            <fieldText>
                <stringValue>Error: Account Number format is invalid.

Expected Format: YYYYMCCXXXX
- YYYY: Year (4 digits)
- M: First letter of account name (1 letter)
- C: Numeric category code (1 digit)
- XXXX: Sequential number (4 digits)

Current Value: {!recordData.AccountNumber}

Please correct the account number and try again.</stringValue>
            </fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
